      AnimatedReaction: {fileID: 3538256414719010168, guid: 6b8dd245a4e1d8c48b2809616a868486, type: 3}
      AudioResponse: Happy
    - Dialogue: "I know you don\u2019t have a lot of time for this sort of thing
