      Portrait: {fileID: 0}
      AnimatedReaction: {fileID: 0}
      AudioResponse: 
    - Dialogue: But, um, back to soccer...
      Portrait: {fileID: 0}
      AnimatedReaction: {fileID: 0}
      AudioResponse: 
    - Dialogue: I was thinking about joining the soccer team next year.
      Portrait: {fileID: 0}
      AnimatedReaction: {fileID: 0}
      AudioResponse: 
    - Dialogue: Would you be willing to show me a thing or two to get a head start?
      Portrait: {fileID: 0}
      AnimatedReaction: {fileID: 0}
      AudioResponse: 
    - Dialogue: It would be great to start learning from someone as good at it as
        you!
      Portrait: {fileID: 0}
      AnimatedReaction: {fileID: 0}
      AudioResponse: 
    PlayerDialogue: "I don\u2019t know. I haven\u2019t played in a long time."
    RelationshipCheckRequired: 0
